<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#030507"><title>{% block title %}Обучение{% endblock %} · MSavin</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/bootstrap.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/learning-paths.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/ajax.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/msavin-theme.css?v=msavin-2"><script src="/assets/ajax.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/student.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/coding-editor.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/catalog.js" defer></script></head>
<body class="msavin-shell" data-ajax-app data-current-user="{{ current_user_id() }}"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">К содержимому</a>
<aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="{{ path('dashboard') }}"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">M</span><span class="brand-copy">MSavin<small>LEARNING</small></span></a><div class="nav-label">РАБОЧЕЕ ПРОСТРАНСТВО</div><nav aria-label="Основная навигация">{% if can('statistics.view') %}<a class="nav-item {{ app.request.attributes.get('_route') == 'dashboard' ? 'active' : '' }}" href="{{ path('dashboard') }}"><span>◫</span> Обзор платформы</a>{% endif %}<a class="nav-item {{ app.request.attributes.get('_route') != 'dashboard' and not (app.request.attributes.get('_route') starts with 'learning_path_') and not (app.request.attributes.get('_route') starts with 'mentor_') ? 'active' : '' }}" href="{{ path('courses') }}"><span>▤</span> Мои курсы</a><a class="nav-item {{ app.request.attributes.get('_route') starts with 'learning_path_' ? 'active' : '' }}" href="{{ path('learning_path_index') }}"><span>◇</span> Направления</a>{% if can_any('course.edit') %}<a class="nav-item {{ app.request.attributes.get('_route') starts with 'mentor_' ? 'active' : '' }}" href="{{ path('mentor_learning') }}"><span>⇢</span> Маршруты учеников</a>{% endif %}{% if can('access.manage') %}<a class="nav-item" href="{{ path('access_index') }}">Разрешения пользователей</a>{% endif %}<a class="nav-item" href="{{ path('student_home') }}">Мой путь</a></nav><div class="sidebar-note"><span class="live-dot"></span> Демонстрационный режим<p>Один ученик. Ваше пространство для обучения и новых идей.</p></div><div class="profile"><span class="avatar">ДУ</span><div>{{ current_user_id() }}<small>Локальная личность</small></div></div></aside>
<div class="workspace"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-context"><span class="topbar-product">MSavin <span>/</span> Обучение</span><span class="demo-badge"><i></i> Локальный режим</span></div>{% include '_session_menu.html.twig' %}</header><main id="main-content">{% for message in app.flashes('success') %}<div class="alert alert-success" role="status">{{ message }}</div>{% endfor %}{% block body %}{% endblock %}</main><footer><a href="https://msavin-mentor.ru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MSavin</a><span>Учитесь последовательно. Двигайтесь вперёд.</span></footer></div>
</body></html>
